OWNER-STANDING-GRANT-1 / charter decision rule 9; fleet_budget workers was 31 against a cap of 30 before this fold).

Its code (errata watch, respond and publish, itself the host of three folded members) runs unchanged as the member
errataMod inside qnfo-research-exec/worker.js (member version 1.4.2-folded): only its two node:buffer imports (now one host
import), its VERSION line and its export differ. The host's */15 tick runs its three jobs at their own minutes (:00 watch,
:15 respond, :30 publish), awaited, with PAPERS_DB on the host's LIVING_PAPER and WATCH_DB/AUDIT_DB on QNFO_AUDIT; GRAPH_DB,
